      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Propaganda; overall-intent-description: The image features a large female gender symbol against a pink background with text listing rights such as 'the right to love who they want,' 'the right to equal pay,' and 'the right to become a citizen and work hard like the rest.' The overall intent is propagandistic, aiming to advocate for gender equality and women's rights by framing these as fundamental, deserved rights. The visual and textual elements are juxtaposed to reinforce a message of empowerment and social justice, encouraging viewers to support these causes. There is no toxicity present in the image; it does not contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or other forms of harmful content. The intent is to promote awareness and advocacy for women's rights and equality.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_392fcf52"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
